<p class="govuk-body">In your court order, this is called a <strong>mental health treatment</strong>. It means you get treatment and support for your mental health.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">The treatment will depend on your needs. It will be provided by a qualified mental health professional.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">It is important to remember if you do not take part in a <strong>mental health treatment</strong>, you could go back to court.</p>
